---
// [HF-ADMIN-COMPLETE-1] Retired old-brand page (it read the old orders/payments tables and the tokens-era wallet, so it showed no the call app data). The island code stays in islands/admin2; this route sends the admin to the the call app page instead. ?user=<uid> opens that member.
export const prerender = false;
const w = Astro.url.searchParams.get('user');
return Astro.redirect(w ? `/admin/hosts/desk?tab=members&uid=${encodeURIComponent(w)}` : '/admin/hosts/desk', 302);
---
